sequenceDiagram
    participant browser
    participant server

    Note right of browser: User writes a note and clicks "Save"

    Note right of browser: JavaScript intercepts the form submit event

    browser->>server: POST https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/new_note_spa
    activate server
    Note right of server: Server saves the new note
    server-->>browser: JSON response (status OK / created note)
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: Browser updates the notes list using JavaScript

    Note right of browser: No page reload, UI re-renders with new note
